  "rationale": "The exploration has identified a feasible Pareto front dominated by pipelined and pipelined_m architectures. The best design (pipelined_m, m=5) achieves the minimum area objective (luts_plus_ffs=1121) while satisfying all constraints: throughput (80.6 MSPS >= 32), accuracy (12.2 bits > 12), and system latency (0.161 us < 0.44 us). The front covers the trade-off space well, with area ranging from 1121 to 1966 and accuracy from 12.2 to 12.9 bits. Since this is the final round and the front is well-established with clear feasible designs meeting all constraints, stopping is the appropriate decision. The selection rule (min luts_plus_ffs) will pick the pipelined_m design at 1121 LUTs+FFs."
}
